                <pb facs="0121" n="111" xml:id="pg111"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1011: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hornibrook</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-07T17:00:00-05:00">December 7, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. For Corrigan. Your no. 32, December 6, 1 p.m. and 33, December 6, 8 p.m. In
                    view of the expressed willingness of the Nicaraguan delegation to waive
                    insistence on point 6 you are authorized in your discretion to agree to its
                    elimination if in your judgement it is essential in order to expedite signature
                    of the agreement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
